{
  "uid": "talkcal-product",
  "title": "talkcal — 產品指標",
  "description": "功能有沒有人用、助理的提議有沒有用處（#36）。指標怎麼埋、為什麼這樣定，見 ops/README.md 的「產品指標」。",
  "tags": [
    "talkcal",
    "product"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "活躍使用者（日／週）",
      "description": "talkcal_active_users{window}：最近 1 天、7 天內跟助理說過話或存過行程的人數（不同的人，同一個人只算一次）。從資料庫數，每分鐘重數一次，所以不受時間範圍影響。只看月曆不算（讀取沒有留下紀錄）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(talkcal_active_users{job=\"talkcal-app\",window=\"1d\"})",
          "legendFormat": "日活",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max(talkcal_active_users{job=\"talkcal-app\",window=\"7d\"})",
          "legendFormat": "週活",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "助理對話次數",
      "description": "助理成功回了幾句話（POST /api/calendar/assistant 的 200）。直接用 Spring 本來就有的 http_server_requests，不另外埋一個一樣的 counter。代價：這條序列要等第一個請求才出現，increase() 會少算 app 啟動後的第一句。數的是右上角選的時間範圍（用 increase()，會依抓取間隔外插，數字小時可能差一兩個）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"talkcal-app\",uri=\"/api/calendar/assistant\",method=\"POST\",status=\"200\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "對話",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "提議卡片",
      "description": "talkcal_assistant_proposals_shown_total：助理的回覆裡真的出現在畫面上的卡片張數（工具解析出來但因為沒講早上晚上被擋下的、回覆失敗的都不算）。數的是右上角選的時間範圍（用 increase()，會依抓取間隔外插，數字小時可能差一兩個）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(talkcal_assistant_proposals_shown_total{job=\"talkcal-app\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "提議",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "採納／拒絕",
      "description": "採納 = talkcal_calendar_events_added_total{origin=\"assistant\"}：從卡片按「加入行事曆」或「修改」後存的。拒絕 = talkcal_assistant_proposals_dismissed_total：按「取消」「移除」的。兩邊都由伺服器核對卡片的 id，每張卡片最多算一次。沒表態的（直接清空對話）兩邊都不算。數的是右上角選的時間範圍（用 increase()，會依抓取間隔外插，數字小時可能差一兩個）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(talkcal_calendar_events_added_total{job=\"talkcal-app\",origin=\"assistant\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "採納",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(talkcal_assistant_proposals_dismissed_total{job=\"talkcal-app\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "拒絕",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "採納率",
      "description": "有表態的卡片裡，被採納的比例：採納 ÷（採納 + 拒絕）。這是「助理提議得準不準」的主指標。下面的「對提議的採納率」分母是全部提議，連沒表態的也算進去。數的是右上角選的時間範圍（用 increase()，會依抓取間隔外插，數字小時可能差一兩個）。沒有任何表態時沒有值（不是 0%）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(talkcal_calendar_events_added_total{job=\"talkcal-app\",origin=\"assistant\"}[$__range])) / (sum(increase(talkcal_calendar_events_added_total{job=\"talkcal-app\",origin=\"assistant\"}[$__range])) + sum(increase(talkcal_assistant_proposals_dismissed_total{job=\"talkcal-app\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "採納率",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.7
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "卡片的去向（每小時）",
      "description": "每小時提議了幾張、採納幾張、拒絕幾張。提議比採納＋拒絕多出來的，就是沒表態的卡片。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
